REP MOVS / STOS fast path (M9 track, docs/tracks/m9-tcg-aarch64.md): a run
inside one page of the source and of the destination probed once and done
with the host libc, the instruction re-entered per page; `-cpu …,rep-fast=off`
keeps the per-element loop. See the comments in mem_helper.c / translate.c and
the patch README row. Test: tools/rep-guest-test.py.

